Z||000006||HummelHund||09-04-2001||05:07 PM||||I was looking at the 84' Pontiac Full-Line brochure I have and it looks like the Firebirds/Trans Ams of that era had the same style power window and power mirror switches as the Fiero does. I don't know if the screws holding the switches on are in the same pattern, though. I just ordered a brand new set from the Fiero Store, they're not too expensive (they're black, too).<P><BR>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE 2M4 WS6, The "Buzz Bomb". (restoration project to become daily driver)<BR>84' SE 2M4 WS6 (Dad's Project)<p>[This message has been edited by HummelHund (edited 09-04-2001).]||||reg||1
